msgid ""
"<h1>Mouse</h1> This module allows you to choose various options for the way "
"in which your pointing device works. Your pointing device may be a mouse, "
"trackball, or some other hardware that performs a similar function."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Muis</h1>"
" Hierdie module laat toe jy na kies verskeie opsies vir die weg in wat jou "
"aanwys toestel werk. jou aanwys toestel dalk mag wees 'n Muis, volgbal, of "
"sommige ander hardeware wat verrig 'n soortgelyk funksie."

